<title>USA: Columbia/HCA Healthcare Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Columbia/HCA Healthcare Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr		    $0.70		    $0.61</p>
<p> Net			    479			416</p>
<p> Revs			 5,328		    4,951</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 679,705		  678,048</p>
<p>(All dollar amounts in millions, except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company reported operating income of $1.263 million versus $1.121 million.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 First Call analyst's estimate $0.70.</p>
<p>The company's full name is Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp.</p>
